{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/3c247acacbec4d44256a31914c50bf34.avif?t=1772344004\" width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be launching a crowdfunding campaign on May 14th, 6:15pm ET.  Pre-Launch page out, follow us on Kickstarter! The future of PROJECT MIX depends on the crowdfund.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.poster.avif?t=1772344004\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.webm?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.mp4?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROJECT MIX </strong>is a VR anime narrative game.<strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in alternate-history 90s Hong Kong, you play as Rone, a young former thug starting a new beginning to try to leave behind his life of crime. He unexpectedly becomes a bartender after a chance meeting with Valencia, the eccentric bar owner of Eleventh Heaven in the seedy Mong Kok district.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At first, you live by the paycheck working at Eleventh Heaven, but as you find yourself hearing a bit too much for your own good, you find yourself thrown into a deep conspiracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.poster.avif?t=1772344004\" width=750 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.webm?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.mp4?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters and learn about Mong Kok from differing perspectives.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.poster.avif?t=1772344004\" width=688 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.webm?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.mp4?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shake, pour, decorate, and serve. Interactive bartending mechanics built from the ground up for VR. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you choose to serve changes the lives of your clients, and even the game narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.poster.avif?t=1772344004\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.webm?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.mp4?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on the small and subtle moments, such as having a smoke after work, sharing a drink, and petting your cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world through gorgeous and atmospheric environments featuring stylized anime visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.poster.avif?t=1772344004\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.webm?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.mp4?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive <strong>character moments</strong> and relationship building with detailed <strong>romance</strong> routes. Meet a variety of characters from all walks of life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack tailored especially for the game, ranging from jazz, synthpop to citypop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different play modes supported.</strong> The game can be played comfortably seated or standing, and even in your bed if you dare so.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-VR Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While our long-term vision is to build the leading VR anime/Asian game studio, we want as many people as possible to experience PROJECT MIX. If we can meet our <strong>funding stretch goals</strong>, we will definitely develop a non-VR version.<br><br>However, it won't be a basic first-person mode that any modder can throw together. Instead, it will feature <strong>completely redesigned controls</strong>, <strong>cinematic camera work</strong>, and <strong>tailored UI visuals</strong>, to more closely match what you may expect from <i>Catherine</i> or the <i>Persona</i> series. It will be a title that stands on it's own.<br><br>But it also means it will require extra time as well as skills we don't have, so the stretch goal funding will be essential.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2439770?t=1772344004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/ffcda2be758909ff52e4a01d7bc2de801091cde7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772344004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/9f0b82653958205fd2c18ac6bd0c7ef2afd49293/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772344004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/9f0b82653958205fd2c18ac6bd0c7ef2afd49293/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772344004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is strong sexual language, but any sexual content will be implied and not shown explicitly. Expect lots of suggestive and risque fan service elements though. There is alcohol drinking and bartending in the game. There is also smoking, but that is optional. The game is for mature audiences."},"demos":[{"appid":2714490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/3c247acacbec4d44256a31914c50bf34.avif?t=1772344004\" width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be launching a crowdfunding campaign on May 14th, 6:15pm ET.  Pre-Launch page out, follow us on Kickstarter! The future of PROJECT MIX depends on the crowdfund.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.poster.avif?t=1772344004\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.webm?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/13a805a1950138702b53fba3d70f28cc.mp4?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROJECT MIX </strong>is a VR anime narrative game.<strong>  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in alternate-history 90s Hong Kong, you play as Rone, a young former thug starting a new beginning to try to leave behind his life of crime. He unexpectedly becomes a bartender after a chance meeting with Valencia, the eccentric bar owner of Eleventh Heaven in the seedy Mong Kok district.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At first, you live by the paycheck working at Eleventh Heaven, but as you find yourself hearing a bit too much for your own good, you find yourself thrown into a deep conspiracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.poster.avif?t=1772344004\" width=750 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.webm?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/604050ae078352fcff1439cb1f1a7048.mp4?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters and learn about Mong Kok from differing perspectives.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.poster.avif?t=1772344004\" width=688 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.webm?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/86f8e1a5a005d41bf477fa0db6dd137b.mp4?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shake, pour, decorate, and serve. Interactive bartending mechanics built from the ground up for VR. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you choose to serve changes the lives of your clients, and even the game narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.poster.avif?t=1772344004\" width=600 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.webm?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/cb87d44b6a01a0e65ec03ed9518b4eaf.mp4?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on the small and subtle moments, such as having a smoke after work, sharing a drink, and petting your cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world through gorgeous and atmospheric environments featuring stylized anime visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.poster.avif?t=1772344004\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.webm?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/44212cc8947fa146ac1509d9956e7abb.mp4?t=1772344004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive <strong>character moments</strong> and relationship building with detailed <strong>romance</strong> routes. Meet a variety of characters from all walks of life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack tailored especially for the game, ranging from jazz, synthpop to citypop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different play modes supported.</strong> The game can be played comfortably seated or standing, and even in your bed if you dare so.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-VR Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While our long-term vision is to build the leading VR anime/Asian game studio, we want as many people as possible to experience PROJECT MIX. If we can meet our <strong>funding stretch goals</strong>, we will definitely develop a non-VR version.<br><br>However, it won't be a basic first-person mode that any modder can throw together. Instead, it will feature <strong>completely redesigned controls</strong>, <strong>cinematic camera work</strong>, and <strong>tailored UI visuals</strong>, to more closely match what you may expect from <i>Catherine</i> or the <i>Persona</i> series. It will be a title that stands on it's own.<br><br>But it also means it will require extra time as well as skills we don't have, so the stretch goal funding will be essential.</p>","developers":["PLECTRUM SOFT"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/2fadcab6477c13391145c4846406ed99624563cc/header.jpg?t=1772344004","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 Plectrum Software. \u201cProject Mix\u201d is a registered trademark of Plectrum Software. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2439770/821917/ec0e1c7a1e998a1615ff38a6e3b5fc61ab70b9d8/1750919222/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740434831","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2439770/821917/ec0e1c7a1e998a1615ff38a6e3b5fc61ab70b9d8/1750919222/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740434831","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2439770/821917/ec0e1c7a1e998a1615ff38a6e3b5fc61ab70b9d8/1750919222/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740434831","id":257094158,"name":"February 2025 Gameplay Teaser 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257094158/1c46921be7beb1ad2382ed7dd1f04eeaa2b1a1e8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740434831"},{"dash_av1":"https://video